                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJdSdIyfepQjQRR91GnujqVSw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1ME5YUnFka2RHV1ZOMk9VbGZkalJaZW05T2JIYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "⭐ A hidden gem restaurant is tucked away inside the National Taiwan University College of Medicine Library! 😂📚✨\n\nI wasn\u0027t there to study, I was drawn in by the food.\n\nThe meat sauce crepe with vegetables was insanely fragrant.\n\nThe chickpea salad was so refreshing it felt like a healthy advertisement.\n\nThe curry had perfectly balanced spices.\n\nThe pesto seafood risotto was delicious.\n\nThe berry pancakes were a total dessert lover\u0027s dream! ❤️🫐 The pancakes were crispy on the outside and soft on the inside, piled high with berries—the sweet and sour flavor was just right. Add ice cream and it was a total win; one bite and my mood increased by 200%.\n\nThe environment was quiet and comfortable, not rushed at all, super chill—a true hidden gem in the library.\n\n✨ Conclusion: I didn\u0027t come for the books, I came for the food. Highly recommended! 🔥🍽️🧇",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "⭐ 台大醫學院圖書館裡竟然藏了一家神級祕密餐廳 😂📚✨\n\n不是來讀書，是被美食吸進來的。\n\n肉醬千層佐蔬菜 香到離譜、\n鷹嘴豆沙拉 清爽得像在做健康業配、\n咖哩 香料乖乖的不亂跳、\n青醬海鮮燉飯 很好吃\n莓果鬆餅 更是直接收服甜點控 ❤️🫐\n鬆餅外脆內軟，堆滿莓果、酸甜剛好，加上冰淇淋根本完勝，吃一口心情直接 +200%。\n\n環境安靜又舒服，不趕人，超級chill，完完全全是圖書館裡的隱藏補給站。\n\n✨ 結論：來這不是為了書，是為了吃。推爆！🔥🍽️🧇",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
